import LOEIS.A035.A035252.Defs

set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A035252

Indices of the nonzero terms in expansion of Dirichlet series Product_p (1-(Kronecker(m,p)+1)*p^(-s)+Kronecker(m,p)*p^(-2s))^(-1) for m= 3.

The 59 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A035252

/-- Known terms of `A035252`, starting at index `1`. -/
def data : List retType :=
  [1, 3, 4, 9, 11, 12, 13, 16, 23, 25,
    27, 33, 36, 37, 39, 44, 47, 48, 49, 52,
    59, 61, 64, 69, 71, 73, 75, 81, 83, 92,
    97, 99, 100, 107, 108, 109, 111, 117, 121, 131,
    132, 141, 143, 144, 147, 148, 156, 157, 167, 169,
